# T-328/L1: Windows and Linux/CUDA share onnxruntime 1.31.1 (same engine as the
# Rust ort backend -- prerequisite for golden-corpus event agreement >=98%).
# No 1.31 wheel exists for onnxruntime-directml (stuck at 1.24.4), so Windows
# inference falls back to the CPU EP (Engine registry degrades directml->cpu).
# R2-303 restores DirectML as an optional second lock (requirements-win-dml.lock).
